From a003f731208e91f561a8b75ad75fa852ccaaf16d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alain Volmat <alain.volmat@foss.st.com>
Date: Fri, 19 Dec 2025 16:58:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: media: st: dcmipp: add 'power-domains' property

STM32 DCMIPP may be in a power domain which is the case for the
STM32MP2x based boards.
Allow a single 'power-domains' entry for STM32 DCMIPP.

Change-Id: Ib8aa42e6addc1e8b95f1147abce628f214ab1c3c
Signed-off-by: Alain Volmat <alain.volmat@foss.st.com>
Acked-by: Krzysztof Kozlowski <krzysztof.kozlowski@oss.qualcomm.com>
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20251219-stm32-mp2x-dcmipp-csi-power-domain-v1-4-a6edb2aa8154@foss.st.com
Signed-off-by: Alexandre Torgue <alexandre.torgue@foss.st.com>
(cherry picked from commit 196369e3823ed10ff42364f580164640255f5a4c)
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/566525
Reviewed-by: Alain VOLMAT <alain.volmat@st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Domain-Review: Hugues FRUCHET <hugues.fruchet@st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Tested-by: Hugues FRUCHET <hugues.fruchet@st.com>
Reviewed-by: Hugues FRUCHET <hugues.fruchet@st.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/st,stm32-dcmipp.yaml | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/st,stm32-dcmipp.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/st,stm32-dcmipp.yaml
index 7b03a77adbce..162a0c526d5d 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/st,stm32-dcmipp.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/st,stm32-dcmipp.yaml
@@ -37,6 +37,9 @@ properties:
   resets:
     maxItems: 1
 
+  power-domains:
+    maxItems: 1
+
   access-controllers:
     minItems: 1
     maxItems: 2
-- 
